{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/40920-help-the-developer-re-the-lunar-exalted","id":40920,"title":"Help the Developer: Re: the Lunar Exalted","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T22:07:14-08:00","id":40920,"title":"Help the Developer: Re: the Lunar Exalted","content":"If you are interested in contributing to the good of Lunars in EX3, please aid us in an experiment. <br /> <br /> Make three 2.5 Lunar characters, one of each caste, with starting character creation rules. Make each caste compliment the other, with mostly different Charms. Make each caste perform to the typical role of its caste.<br /> <br /> Reply to this thread with each of your three sample Lunars's traits and Charms. Explain why you gave them the Charms you did, and how they compliment one another. <br /> <br /> I apologize but I am too busy to answer questions about this experiment. Just know that your participation will be appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T23:29:16-08:00","id":40938,"title":"","content":"I do wish I could help by making 1st ed Characters as that is the system i'm more familiar with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>1","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27-ulfsarkar","name":"Ulfsarkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T00:38:39-08:00","id":40962,"title":"","content":"I would, but literally any other Lunar aside from Full Moon have massive gaps in their charmset. And by massive gap, I mean their trees barely give them the capabilities they need.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T01:17:55-08:00","id":40974,"title":"","content":"I will do this once it is not 4am where I am. I'm not the greatest at chargen, but it'll still be a fun challenge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T01:21:38-08:00","id":40976,"title":"","content":"I'd love to help.. and if you were asking for Abyssals I'd be more than happy to help. However I know absolutely nothing about Lunars... they never held any appeal to me whatsoever (second most boring splat aside from the dragon blooded IMO) so I'd likely do you a disservice by giving it a shot. Please remind me when/if you want Abyssals in the future and I'll create for you the most perfect circle in the entire underworld.... and if you just want 3? I'll create a triforce so amazing the First and Forsaken Lion will resign as Deathlord out of sheee dismay due to his uselessness","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/488-blackwood","name":"Blackwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T01:33:30-08:00","id":40981,"title":"","content":"No Casteless? Thank goodness. I'll get this done ASAP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T01:39:20-08:00","id":40982,"title":"","content":"I have blather below, but I'd like to lead with a thank you for launching this experiment. ^__^ Community engagement like this is always awesome, it's an interesting approach, and I'm hopeful what you get from it is a help. I'm also hopeful you'll share what you were driving at, when you have time to do so or feel it's gone long enough to gauge the progression.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/40920-help-the-developer-re-the-lunar-exalted?p=40962#post40962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would, but literally any other Lunar aside from Full Moon have massive gaps in their charmset. And by massive gap, I mean their trees barely give them the capabilities they need.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just using this as a jumping off point.<br /> <br /> I think John and Holden are aware of many places in which Lunars fall short. Hell, some of Holden's (and Stephen's?) essays probably did a lot to highlight many of those problems before there was even public talk of EX3.<br /> <br /> Given that they know many of the 2.5 Lunar issues, there's still value in looking at the current user experience of creating a Lunar. What people want to make, how they go about trying to make it, how well they feel the present setup supports them, where it breaks down for them, where it surprises them (good or bad), stuff they need that isn't there, how happy they are with the end result, etc. are all useful data points. Finding that some people are too frustrated to even want to bother -- I'm debating whether or not I fall into that group -- is also helpful, particularly if mentioning specifics about what makes them throw up their hands. This helps the devs identify the big inadequacies people find, to avoid, and the sorts of concepts people want to turn into Lunars in the first place, to help when deciding what EX3 Lunars need.<br /> <br /> It also helps ensure any things people actually like about the execution aren't ditched out of hand. You will find few with more disdain for the Lunar Charmset than me, but I sometimes wonder if that's got me blinded a little; I've been surprised when reminded of a few cool things Lunars actually have in there. If there's a place for any of that stuff in the EX3 Lunar paradigm (or any other Exalt's/splat's), this is a good exercise to help salvage it.<br /> <br /> Gonna decide whether I have the time to go about this... &gt;.&gt; Any chance there's a particular timeframe, John?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":". 01-02-2014, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T02:17:27-08:00","id":40991,"title":"","content":"For the sake of sanity, shall we assume that Fair Folk stuff is off-limits?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T02:22:01-08:00","id":40992,"title":"","content":"First of mine.<br /> <br /> Changing Moon<br /> <br /> Spirit Shape: Kitty!<br /> Strength 2 Dexterity 5 Stamina 2<br /> <b>Charisma 5 Manipulation 3 Appearance 5</b><br /> Perception 2 Intelligence 2 <b>Wits 3</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Favoured:<br /> Martial Arts 2 Survival 2<br /> Other:<br /> Athletics 2 (+1 rooftops) Awareness 2 Dodge 3 Integrity 3 Lore 1 (social customs +1) Occult 1 Larceny 2 Linguistics 2 Presence 3 (making friends +1) Socialize 2 (poker face +1)<br /> <br /> Compassion 3 Conviction 2 Temperance 2 Valour 2<br /> Essence 3<br /> Willpower 10<br /> <br /> Knacks:<br /> Hybrid Body Rearrangement<br /> <br /> Charms:<br /> First Charisma Excellency<br /> First Manipulation Excellency<br /> Third Appearance Excellency<br /> Perfect Symmetry<br /> Hide of the Cunning Hunter<br /> Shifting Penumbra Stance<br /> Irresistible Silver Spirit<br /> <br /> Backgrounds:<br /> Will be added as necessary","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_li