f the Cunning Hunter to enjoy the his healing Charms and increased attributes as indefinite Gift benefits while looking human; he claims to be a the wandering son of an eastern bull-god, and the Stampede Shogun (a secret ally of the Silver Pacts) confirms this story when asked. This allows Sheep to use his supernatural prowess without arousing suspicion even in Immaculate-controlled regions and satrapies. As a measure of safety, he does not carry any moonsilver or in fact any weapon, but he is very apt at tearing off anything in his vicinity and using it as a deadly weapon. </span></span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>No Moon: the Shaman</b></span></span></span><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Name: </b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201cLass\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Spirit Shape: </b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cricket</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Motivation:</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Become the medium between the spirits of the East and Eastern mortals. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Strength 1, Dexterity 5, Stamina 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Charisma 1, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Manipulation 4,</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Appearance 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Intelligence 5, Perception 4, Wits 2</i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Abilities:</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Awareness 3, Dodge 3, Larceny 2, Stealth 3, Linguistics 1 (Old Realm), Presence 3, Socialize 3 (Spirits +1), Lore 1, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Occult 5</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> (Sorcery +1, Elementals +1), </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Survival 3 </i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Forests